# Every source file in this pack is written LF. Without this, a clone on
# Windows checks out CRLF and the next commit shows every line of every file
# as changed -- which would bury real diffs in a pack whose whole value is
# being able to see what changed between renders.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images and video the docs might carry. Deliberately not LFS: they would be
# small, and GitHub LFS has a quota where plain blobs do not.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Below is HuggingFace's default LFS ruleset, kept because this repo is
# mirrored to huggingface.co/sandpies/ComfyUI-Hand-Tie-Clips and the Hub
# refuses a plain blob over 10 MB. Nothing in the pack matches these patterns
# today -- they are here so that the day something does, it lands correctly on
# both hosts rather than failing the push to one of them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
